; Stage 4: lowering, which builds the code-generation tree from the TST. See
; docs/design/lowering.md: [Nodes] is the tree, [Lower] the walk over a
; verb's body that builds it, over [State], [Type_layout], [Literals],
; [Verbs], [Outcome] and [Build]; [Program] lowers a whole program with the
; walk, [Regions] places its arenas, [Traverse] walks and rewrites the tree
; for every pass over it, and [To_tree_graph] renders it for `--cgt`.
